"autoResize": false,
"seed": 307001
},
{
"type": "text",
"id": "ft_p",
"x": 40,
"y": 1688,
"width": 1520,
"height": 30,
"strokeColor": "#94a3b8",
"text": "[07] Capability Taxonomy: a subagent for bounded, parallel, read-mostly work on a cheaper model, returning only a summary to the parent\n[16] The Permission Ladder: its read-only status is a sentence, not a grant: the gap between the prose rung and the configured one, in one file",
"fontSize": 12,
"fontFamily": 3,
"textAlign": "left",
"verticalAlign": "top",
"roughness": 0,
"opacity": 100,
"lineHeight": 1.25,
"autoResize": false,
"seed": 307002
},
{
"type": "text",
"id": "ft_m1",
"x": 40,
"y": 1735,
"width": 1520,
"height": 15,
"strokeColor": "#e0f2fe",
"text": "deliberately missing: a tool grant (one line of frontmatter, the three read tools) would make the body's limits true; the source had the words and not the line",
"fontSize": 12,
"fontFamily": 3,
"textAlign": "left",
"verticalAlign": "top",
"roughness": 0,
"opacity": 100,
"lineHeight": 1.25,
"autoResize": false,
"seed": 307003
},
{
"type": "text",
"id": "ft_m2",
"x": 40,
"y": 1752,
"width": 1520,
"height": 15,
"strokeColor": "#94a3b8",
"text": "· one skip list: the exception list belongs to the scanner script, and the subagent belongs to running it, which needs a narrow command permission, not prose about Bash",
"fontSize": 12,
"fontFamily": 3,
"textAlign": "left",
"verticalAlign": "top",
"roughness": 0,
"opacity": 100,
"lineHeight": 1.25,
"autoResize": false,
"seed": 307004
},
{
"type": "text",
"id": "ft_pr",
"x": 40,
"y": 1785,
"width": 1520,
"height": 45,
"strokeColor": "#94a3b8",
"text": "prototype: a fabricated definition read the way a harness would: it reports the tools granted that the prose forbids and lays the three skip lists side by side;\n--narrowed adds the one frontmatter line that closes the first gap\nin the prototype: no model, no scan and no discovery; the definition is parsed directly, as if a harness had found it",
"fontSize": 12,
"fontFamily": 3,
"textAlign": "left",
"verticalAlign": "top",
"roughness": 0,
"opacity": 100,
"lineHeight": 1.25,
"autoResize": false,
"seed": 307005
}
],
